<title>PHILIPPINES: Cityland says Q3 net at 85.465 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Cityland says Q3 net at 85.465 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>High-rise builder Cityland Development Corp posted a net income of 85.465 million pesos in the third quarter of the year, documents submitted to the Securities and Exchange Commission on Tuesday said.</p>
<p>Revenues reached 176.058 million pesos, while operating expenses amounted to 41.772 million pesos.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
